ite winter sports: off-piste avalanche risk (ARPAV Dolomiti/AINEVA bulletin, European 5-level scale; transceiver/shovel/probe + guide), altitude/AMS (Tofana 3,244 m), via-ferrata exposure (kit + guide), cold/whiteout; rescue 112/118 Soccorso Alpino"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb half-terms + the January World Cup; August summer crest; five-star multiples + min-stay","shoulder":"Early Dec + mid-Jan; golden autumn late Sep-early Oct hiking","green":"Late Apr-May + Nov (many hotels/lifts closed; lowest rates)","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Feb + World Cup 4-9 mo (min-stay); regular winter 2-4 mo; summer 1-3 mo","off_season_specials":"Autumn larch-gold + wellness (Sep-Oct); summer via ferrata + Cinque Torri/Lagazuoi museums + Dolomite touring","event_peaks":"Ski holidays (Dec-Apr), Cortina women''s World Cup (Jan), 2026 Olympic-legacy demand, summer hiking/via ferrata, larch gold (Oct)","campaign_start":"Next winter + World Cup by Jun-Aug (long five-star lead); autumn larch-gold + wellness from spring; Olympic-legacy story year-round"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski the Olympic Tofane from the Freccia nel Cielo","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~EUR 77-86/day pass (approx)","timing":"ski ~5 Dec 2025-12 Apr 2026; verify","commission_path":"school/operator 10-15%","draw_rank":1,"si":"ski","when":"ski ~5 Dec 2025-12 Apr 2026; verify","commission":"school/operator 10-15%"},{"name":"Ski-safari the Sellaronda - 44 km round the Sella massif","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~EUR 77-86/day pass; guide ~EUR 250-400/day (approx)","timing":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb half-terms + the January World Cup","commission_path":"guide/operator 10-15%","draw_rank":2,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the classic one-day lift-linked loop of the Sella group, best with a guide to string it clockwise or anticlockwise","si":"ski","blurb":"th